      "content": "i know people say things get better but they don't get it. they don't see how empty it is. i'm just a ghost in my own life now. i look at the future and there's literally nothing there. no career, no community, just this constant, heavy silence. it feels like i'm just waiting for the world to realize i've already disappeared.",
