      "content": "it's not even about making it to the end of the day anymore. that's what makes it so exhausting. i'm just tired of fighting against a world that's clearly decided i don't belong in it. everything i worked for, everything i was... it's just gone. why should i keep trying to build something on top of ashes? it feels like the only way to actually find some peace is to just stop fighting it.",
